{"id":"the-arkbow","name":"The Arkbow","type":"artifact","aliases":["arkbow","Arkbow","Skalla's last gift"],"description":"The Arkbow is Vivien's bow, an artifact made from the remains of her destroyed home plane Skalla, which preserves dying creatures and summons them as spectral beasts.","pages":9,"first_seen":"2018-08-29","last_seen":"2023-03-20","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Vivien Reid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Vivien Reid\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}],"bio":{"summary":{"text":"The Arkbow is Vivien's bow, an artifact made from the remains of her destroyed home plane Skalla, which preserves dying creatures and summons them as spectral beasts.","cites":["p:wiki/vivien-reid","p:stories/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Vivien Reid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Vivien Reid\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}]},"bio":[{"text":"After Bolas destroyed Skalla, the Nura and Smaragdi made the Arkbow, and Vivien's spark ignited as the forest burned, so she planeswalked away with it.","cites":["vivien-reid-e0"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid#:~:text=Vivien%27s%20spark%20ignited%20%2C,the%20Arkbow%20to%20safety."],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Vivien Reid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid#:~:text=Vivien%27s%20spark%20ignited%20%2C,the%20Arkbow%20to%20safety.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Vivien Reid\", section \"Origin\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"At a gala on Luneau she fired it to summon a spectral hydra, a wurm and a stag that disrupted the nobles' entertainment.","cites":["unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29-e11","luneau-e2"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29#:~:text=the%20seething%2C%20glimmering%20green,the%20world%20to%20see.","https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau#:~:text=Vivien%20used%20her%20Arkbow%20to%20summon%20a%20hydra"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-08-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29#:~:text=the%20seething%2C%20glimmering%20green,the%20world%20to%20see.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 1\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Aug 2018."},{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Luneau","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau#:~:text=Vivien%20used%20her%20Arkbow%20to%20summon%20a%20hydra","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Luneau\", section \"Notable locations\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}]},{"text":"The Baron of Vernot took the bow, could not make it work and offered Vivien glories if she taught him.","cites":["unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e1","unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e9"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Teach%20me%20how%20to,with%20an%20unfulfilled%20desire."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Teach%20me%20how%20to,with%20an%20unfulfilled%20desire.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}]},{"text":"Forced to perform the ritual, Vivien drew a monstrosaur's spirit into it, and the bow burst the guard who tried to use it, since it obeys only her.","cites":["unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e3","unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e4"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20monstrosaur%20did%20not%20resist.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=A%20minute%20spasm%20of,his%20body%20burst%20outward."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20monstrosaur%20did%20not%20resist.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=A%20minute%20spasm%20of,his%20body%20burst%20outward.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}]},{"text":"She then summoned the monstrosaur whole and vengeful, and it rampaged through the ballroom.","cites":["unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e6"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20arrow%20buried%20itself,tore%20itself%20loose%2C%20roaring"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20arrow%20buried%20itself,tore%20itself%20loose%2C%20roaring","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}]},{"text":"She later hurled Lukka away with it and summoned a spectral dreadmaw in the March of the Machine.","cites":["battle-at-the-ozolith-e5","survival-of-the-fittest-e8"],"links":["https://mtg.wiki/page/Battle_at_the_Ozolith#:~:text=attacked%20Lukka%20with%20her%20Arkbow","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survival-of-the-fittest#:~:text=The%20dreadmaw%20simply%20dissolved"],"citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Battle at the Ozolith","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Battle_at_the_Ozolith","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Battle_at_the_Ozolith#:~:text=attacked%20Lukka%20with%20her%20Arkbow","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Battle at the Ozolith\", section \"Description\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"March of the Machine | Ikoria: Survival of the Fittest","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Roy Graham"],"date":"2023-03-20","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survival-of-the-fittest","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/survival-of-the-fittest#:~:text=The%20dreadmaw%20simply%20dissolved","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"March of the Machine | Ikoria: Survival of the Fittest\" by Roy Graham. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 20 Mar 2023."}]}],"status":{"text":"The Arkbow remains with Vivien, who used it in the latest story to summon a spectral dreadmaw that the titan destroyed.","cites":["survival-of-the-fittest-e8","unbowed-part-3-20