#:~:text=The%20Pelakka%20wurm%20launched,sinuous%20body%2C%20glowing%20green.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 1\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Aug 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29-e15","era":null,"summary":"Vivien vows to make Luneau pay and summons a swarm of giant wasps.","participants":["vivien-reid","marcois-jean-jaquent","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29","order":667,"story_date":"2018-08-29","storyline":"Unbowed","source":"wizards","paragraph":129,"quote":"I will see Luneau pay for what it has done to this world.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29#:~:text=I%20will%20see%20Luneau,done%20to%20this%20world.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 1","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-08-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-1-2018-08-29#:~:text=I%20will%20see%20Luneau,done%20to%20this%20world.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 1\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Aug 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e1","era":null,"summary":"The baron describes his failed attempts to use the Arkbow and questions what Vivien is, speculating she is a Planeswalker.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"I wonder if you are a Planeswalker.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e2","era":null,"summary":"Vivien demands the Arkbow back; the baron refuses and presses her on how it works, and she mentions Skalla.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"Return the Arkbow.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Return%20the%20Arkbow.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Return%20the%20Arkbow.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e9","era":null,"summary":"The baron reveals he has deduced Skalla is dead and Vivien is its last living relic, and offers her glories and a queen's place if she teaches him to use the Arkbow.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","skalla","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":66,"quote":"Teach me how to make use of the weapon and 